 abstract = {Objective: The electrocardiogram (ECG) characteristic waveforms include P wave, QRS wave, and T wave. The detection of ECG characteristic waveforms is particularly important in automatic heart disease diagnosis. Although researchers have proposed many detection methods, the detection under the inter-patient pattern is still a challenge.},
